# Calamitous Cave-In: X counts only the Caves you control and the Cave cards in your graveyard.
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts a Phyrexian Walker (0/3) and a Mox Ruby. On turn 2 Bot2 plays a Promising Vein, a Cave, and discards a Pit of
# Offerings (another Cave) to Faithless Looting. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Cave-In
# (Black Lotus and the Mox): it controls no Cave and has none in its graveyard - Bot2's Cave on the battlefield and Cave card
# in its graveyard are not counted - so X = 0 (CR 205.3i) and the Walker stays undamaged
# (CR 120.8: dealing 0 damage deals no damage at all).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Calamitous Cave-In
Phyrexian Walker
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Promising Vein
Black Lotus
Faithless Looting
Pit of Offerings
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Promising Vein.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Pit of Offerings; Island)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 4
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Calamitous Cave-In.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.Damage = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Calamitous Cave-In; Black Lotus
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1
